### ==================================================
### Activity Logging API Tests
### Module: Activity Management & Timeline (Prompt 9)
### ==================================================

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@acmeToken = {{loginAcme.response.body.token}}
@techStartToken = {{loginTechStart.response.body.token}}

### ==================================================
### SETUP - Authentication
### ==================================================

### Login as Acme Tenant
# @name loginAcme
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "email": "john@acme.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login as TechStart Tenant
# @name loginTechStart
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant: techstart

{
  "email": "jane@techstart.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### ==================================================
### ACTIVITY CRUD - Create Activities
### ==================================================

### Create Activity 1 - Phone Call
# @name createActivity1
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/activities
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "type": "CALL",
  "subject": "Discovery Call with Acme Corp",
  "description": "Initial discovery call to discuss their CRM needs. They are currently using spreadsheets and looking to upgrade.",
  "duration": 45,
  "outcome": "Connected",
  "contactId": "contact-1-acme",
  "dealId": "deal-1-acme",
  "occurredAt": "2025-01-05T10:30:00Z"
}

### Create Activity 2 - Email Sent
# @name createActivity2
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/activities
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "type": "EMAIL",
  "subject": "Follow-up: CRM Proposal",
  "description": "Sent detailed proposal with pricing and implementation timeline. Proposal includes three tiers: Basic, Professional, and Enterprise.",
  "contactId": "contact-1-acme",
  "dealId": "deal-1-acme",
  "emailMessageId": "msg-12345-67890",
  "metadata": {
    "to": "contact@acmecorp.com",
    "cc": ["manager@acmecorp.com"],
    "attachments": ["proposal.pdf", "pricing.xlsx"]
  },
  "occurredAt": "2025-01-05T14:00:00Z"
}

### Create Activity 3 - Meeting Scheduled
# @name createActivity3
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/activities
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "type": "MEETING",
  "subject": "Product Demo - Tawasol CRM",
  "description": "Scheduled product demonstration for decision makers. Will cover contact management, deal pipeline, and reporting features.",
  "duration": 60,
  "contactId": "contact-2-acme",
  "dealId": "deal-1-acme",
  "metadata": {
    "meetingType": "Video",
    "platform": "Zoom",
    "attendees": ["John Smith", "Sarah Johnson", "Mike Davis"]
  },
  "occurredAt": "2025-01-06T15:00:00Z"
}

### Create Activity 4 - Note Added
# @name createActivity4
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/activities
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "type": "NOTE",
  "subject": "Customer Feedback",
  "description": "Customer mentioned they are also evaluating Salesforce and HubSpot. Key differentiator for them is ease of use and pricing. They have a budget of $5,000/month.",
  "contactId": "contact-1-acme",
  "dealId": "deal-1-acme",
  "occurredAt": "2025-01-05T16:30:00Z"
}

### Create Activity 5 - Call with Voicemail
# @name createActivity5
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/activities
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "type": "CALL",
  "subject": "Follow-up Call",
  "description": "Attempted to reach decision maker to discuss next steps.",
  "duration": 2,
  "outcome": "Left Voicemail",
  "recordingUrl": "https://recordings.example.com/call-12345.mp3",
  "contactId": "contact-2-acme",
  "occurredAt": "2025-01-07T09:00:00Z"
}

### Create Activity 6 - Support Ticket Related
# @name createActivity6
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/activities
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "type": "CALL",
  "subject": "Support Call - Login Issue",
  "description": "Customer called regarding login issues. Helped reset password and verified account access. Issue resolved.",
  "duration": 15,
  "outcome": "Issue Resolved",
  "contactId": "contact-3-acme",
  "ticketId": "ticket-1-acme",
  "occurredAt": "2025-01-07T11:00:00Z"
}

### Create Activity for TechStart Tenant
# @name createActivityTechStart
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/activities
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{techStartToken}}
X-Tenant: techstart

{
  "type": "MEETING",
  "subject": "Onboarding Session",
  "description": "Initial onboarding session with new customer. Covered system setup, user roles, and best practices.",
  "duration": 90,
  "contactId": "contact-1-techstart",
  "occurredAt": "2025-01-05T13:00:00Z"
}

### ==================================================
### VALIDATION TESTS
### ==================================================

### Create Activity - Missing Type (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/activities
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "subject": "Test Activity",
  "contactId": "contact-1-acme"
}

### Create Activity - Missing Subject (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/activities
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "type": "CALL",
  "contactId": "contact-1-acme"
}

### Create Activity - Missing ContactId (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/activities
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "type": "CALL",
  "subject": "Test Activity"
}

### Create Activity - Invalid Type (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/activities
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "type": "INVALID_TYPE",
  "subject": "Test Activity",
  "contactId": "contact-1-acme"
}

### Create Activity - Invalid Contact (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/activities
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "type": "CALL",
  "subject": "Test Activity",
  "contactId": "non-existent-contact"
}

### Create Activity - Invalid Deal (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/activities
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "type": "CALL",
  "subject": "Test Activity",
  "contactId": "contact-1-acme",
  "dealId": "non-existent-deal"
}

### ==================================================
### READ OPERATIONS
### ==================================================

### Get All Activities (Acme Tenant)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/activities
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Get All Activities with Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/activities?page=1&limit=3
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Get Activity by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/activities/{{createActivity1.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### ==================================================
### SEARCH & FILTERS
### ==================================================

### Search by Subject
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/activities?search=Discovery
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Search by Description
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/activities?search=proposal
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Filter by Type - CALL
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/activities?type=CALL
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Filter by Type - EMAIL
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/activities?type=EMAIL
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Filter by Type - MEETING
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/activities?type=MEETING
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Filter by Type - NOTE
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/activities?type=NOTE
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Filter by Contact
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/activities?contactId=contact-1-acme
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Filter by Deal
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/activities?dealId=deal-1-acme
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Filter by Ticket
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/activities?ticketId=ticket-1-acme
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Filter by Current User (using "me")
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/activities?userId=me
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Filter by Specific User
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/activities?userId=user-1-acme
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Filter by Date Range - Today
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/activities?startDate=2025-01-05T00:00:00Z&endDate=2025-01-05T23:59:59Z
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Filter by Date Range - This Week
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/activities?startDate=2025-01-01T00:00:00Z&endDate=2025-01-07T23:59:59Z
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Combined Filters - Calls for Specific Contact
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/activities?type=CALL&contactId=contact-1-acme
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Combined Filters - Deal Activities This Week
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/activities?dealId=deal-1-acme&startDate=2025-01-01T00:00:00Z&endDate=2025-01-07T23:59:59Z
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### ==================================================
### SORTING
### ==================================================

### Sort by Occurred Date (DESC - Most recent first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/activities?sortBy=occurredAt&sortOrder=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Sort by Occurred Date (ASC - Oldest first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/activities?sortBy=occurredAt&sortOrder=asc
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Sort by Type
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/activities?sortBy=type&sortOrder=asc
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### ==================================================
### ACTIVITY FEED
### ==================================================

### Get Activity Feed - All Activities
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/activities/feed
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Get Activity Feed - For Specific Contact
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/activities/feed?entityType=contact&entityId=contact-1-acme
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Get Activity Feed - For Specific Deal
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/activities/feed?entityType=deal&entityId=deal-1-acme
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Get Activity Feed - For Specific Ticket
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/activities/feed?entityType=ticket&entityId=ticket-1-acme
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Get Activity Feed - Current User's Activities
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/activities/feed?userId=me
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Get Activity Feed - Date Range
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/activities/feed?startDate=2025-01-05T00:00:00Z&endDate=2025-01-06T23:59:59Z
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Get Activity Feed - With Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/activities/feed?page=1&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Get Activity Feed - Invalid Entity Type (should fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/activities/feed?entityType=invalid&entityId=some-id
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### ==================================================
### UPDATE OPERATIONS
### ==================================================

### Update Activity - Basic Fields
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/activities/{{createActivity1.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "subject": "Discovery Call with Acme Corp - UPDATED",
  "description": "Updated: Initial discovery call went very well. They are highly interested in our solution.",
  "duration": 50
}

### Update Activity - Change Outcome
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/activities/{{createActivity5.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "outcome": "Connected - Call Back Requested"
}

### Update Activity - Add Deal Reference
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/activities/{{createActivity5.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "dealId": "deal-1-acme"
}

### Update Activity - Update Metadata
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/activities/{{createActivity2.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "metadata": {
    "to": "contact@acmecorp.com",
    "cc": ["manager@acmecorp.com", "ceo@acmecorp.com"],
    "attachments": ["proposal.pdf", "pricing.xlsx", "case-study.pdf"],
    "status": "opened"
  }
}

