### Get Activity Statistics - Specific User
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/activities/stats?userId=user-1-acme
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Get Activity Statistics - Date Range
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/activities/stats?startDate=2025-01-01T00:00:00Z&endDate=2025-01-31T23:59:59Z
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Get Activity Statistics - This Week
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/activities/stats?startDate=2025-01-05T00:00:00Z&endDate=2025-01-11T23:59:59Z
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
