### ==================================================
### TENANT ISOLATION
### ==================================================

### Attempt to Access Acme Activity from TechStart (should fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/activities/{{createActivity1.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{techStartToken}}
X-Tenant: techstart

### Attempt to Update Acme Activity from TechStart (should fail)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/activities/{{createActivity1.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{techStartToken}}
X-Tenant: techstart

{
  "subject": "Attempting to modify another tenant's activity"
}

### Attempt to Delete Acme Activity from TechStart (should fail)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/activities/{{createActivity1.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{techStartToken}}
X-Tenant: techstart

### Verify TechStart Can Only See Their Own Activities
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/activities
Authorization: Bearer {{techStartToken}}
X-Tenant: techstart

### ==================================================
### DELETE OPERATIONS
### ==================================================

### Delete Activity
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/activities/{{createActivity4.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Delete Non-Existent Activity (should fail)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/activities/non-existent-id
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Verify Activity Deleted
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/activities/{{createActivity4.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### ==================================================
### ERROR HANDLING
### ==================================================

### Get Activity - No Authentication (should fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/activities
X-Tenant: acme

### Get Activity - No Tenant Header (should fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/activities
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}

### Get Activity - Invalid Token (should fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/activities
Authorization: Bearer invalid-token-xyz
X-Tenant: acme

### Get Activity - Non-Existent ID (should fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/activities/non-existent-activity-id
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

